<<set $Minutes += 10>>
The crowd gives one final big round of applause as you and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> are walked off stage and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Alistair</span> brings back Mayor King to bring the event to an end. You walk behind <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>, <span style="Color: Yellow">not wanting to say anything until you are off the stage but still have no idea what to say once you are.</span> The lady who brought you over congratulates you both and a few people clap as you walk by. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> smiles and thanks them, heading back to his dressing room to change back into his normal clothes. As you walk in, you open your mouth to say something, but <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> speaks first. <br>

