    <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“It’s fine, really! It was on TV, so I’m sure she still saw it.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> smiles, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Besides, we shouldn’t worry about that! What we should worry about is what kind of pizza we’re going to get! What are you guys feeling?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> looks between you three with a smile. <span style="Color: LightCoral">It isn’t forced, but there is still something about it that makes your chest hurt.</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Callum</span> notices it too, looking disappointed in himself. He then smiles before patting his brother on the head. <br>
